# Skill Governance (imported)

Purpose:
  Skill-library governance meta-skills from artemrudenko/skill-governance-toolkit.
  Evaluate, audit, and port skills — the vetting layer SDDRA skills-meta lacked.

Owns: ./

Source: https://github.com/artemrudenko/skill-governance-toolkit
Origin: fetched from raw.githubusercontent.com (skills/{name}/SKILL.md)
Imported: 2026-09-06
Format: anthropic-skill (SKILL.md docs-only, adapted via INDEX.sdd wrapper)
License: MIT (verified in SKILL.md frontmatter + repo)
Runtime: none (docs-only workflows)

Skills:
  skill-evaluate:
    one_line: Score any SKILL.md across 9 dimensions D1-D9 incl. safety/risk (D9)
    use: vetting external skills before import (Phase 146 candidate gate)
  library-audit:
    one_line: Audit a skill library — handoff contracts, token budget, naming, security baseline
    use: periodic health audit of SDDRA's own skill library
  skill-build-portable:
    one_line: Make a skill spec-compliant/agent-neutral — strip forbidden frontmatter, generalize paths
    use: normalizing imported skills to agent-skills spec before promotion

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @skill-evaluate.md
   3  @library-audit.md
   4  @skill-build-portable.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — run a governance workflow on a skill/library
  AUDIT    — audit-only pass with verdicts

Rules:
  [SG1] These skills gate external imports — run skill-evaluate BEFORE .sdd adoption.
  [SG2] Verdicts follow SDDRA gate semantics (PASS/WARN/BLOCK).
  [SG3] External origin — apply import rules from CLAUDE.md.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

Navigation:
  SkillGovernance: @INDEX.sdd
  SkillEvaluate: @skill-evaluate.md
  LibraryAudit: @library-audit.md
  SkillBuildPortable: @skill-build-portable.md
  ImportedRegistry: @../INDEX.sdd

State: +
